    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#8220;authorized agent&#8221; are to an designated agent for the media, who is responsible for identifying and procuring merchants to purchase ad inventory from the media, facilitating the transaction process, and assisting ad deployment;</span></td></tr>
  </table><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

