    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#8220;China&#8221; or the &#8220;PRC&#8221; are to the People&#8217;s Republic of China, including the special administrative regions of Hong&#160;Kong and Macau and excluding Taiwan for the purposes of this annual report only. The same legal and operational risks associated with operations in mainland China also apply to operations in Hong&#160;Kong;</span></td></tr>
