<ix:continuation id="_ScheduleOfForeignExchangeContractsStatementOfFinancialPositionTableTextBlock-c0_cont_3"><ix:continuation id="_ForeignCurrencyTransactionsAndTranslationsPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_6"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse"> <tr> <td style="vertical-align: bottom">&#160;</td> <td style="vertical-align: bottom">&#160;</td> <td style="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; vertical-align: bottom">&#160;</td> <td colspan="8" style="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; vertical-align: bottom; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>For the&#160;Years Ended <br/>
