<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_ScheduleOfEffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfEffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationTableTextBlock" id="ixv-26815">A reconciliation between the Group&#8217;s actual
provision for income taxes and the provision at Japan statutory rate is as follows:</ix:nonNumeric></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

